==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[dragon]]'s [[blood]]|-}}

# A bright [[red]] [[resin]], obtained from different species of a number of distinct [[plant]]s {{taxlink|Calamus rotang|species|noshow=1}} and genera ''[[Croton]]'', ''[[Dracaena]]'', {{taxlink|Daemonorops|genus|noshow=1}}, and ''[[Pterocarpus]]'', used in the manufacture of [[varnish]]es, [[lacquer]]s, [[medicine]]s, and [[incense]]s.
#* {{quote-book|1=en|year=1936|author=Rollo Ahmed|title=The Black Art|publisher=Long|location=London|page=155|passage=For black magic, assaf&oelig;tida, garlic, '''dragon's blood''', sulphur, and such-like vile-smelling concoctions were used.}}

